VALUES('sentence:2026-08-21.2:de:advanced:library:5','2026-08-21.2','de','advanced','B1+-B2-aligned',5,6,65,'library','hours','Ist die Bibliothek jetzt geöffnet? Ich möchte prüfen, ob der Feiertagsfahrplan den von mir gebuchten Service beeinflusst.','图书馆现在开门吗？ 我想确认节假日安排是否会影响我已经预约的服务。','Is the library open now? I would like to confirm whether the holiday schedule affects the service I booked.','["Ist","die","Bibliothek","jetzt","geöffnet","Ich","möchte","prüfen","ob","der","Feiertagsfahrplan","den","von","mir","gebuchten","Service","beeinflusst"]','die Bibliothek','smartlingo_original_cefr_aligned','published',unixepoch(),unixepoch());
VALUES('sentence:2026-08-21.2:de:advanced:library:6','2026-08-21.2','de','advanced','B1+-B2-aligned',5,5,66,'library','need','Ich muss zu die Bibliothek. Dieser Stopp wirkt sich auf den restlichen Reiseplan aus, deshalb brauche ich eine genaue Ankunftszeit.','我需要去图书馆。 这项安排关系到后面的行程，所以我需要一个准确的到达时间。','I need to go to the library. This stop affects the rest of my itinerary, so I need an accurate arrival time.','["Ich","muss","zu","die","Bibliothek","Dieser","Stopp","wirkt","sich","auf","den","restlichen","Reiseplan","aus","deshalb","brauche","ich","eine","genaue","Ankunftszeit"]','die Bibliothek','smartlingo_original_cefr_aligned','published',unixepoch(),unixepoch());
VALUES('sentence:2026-08-21.2:de:advanced:library:7','2026-08-21.2','de','advanced','B1+-B2-aligned',5,4,67,'library','transport','Bitte bringen Sie mich zu die Bibliothek. Empfehlen Sie mir unter Berücksichtigung der Barrierefreiheit und meines Gepäcks die Route mit den wenigsten Umstiegen.','请带我去图书馆。 考虑到无障碍通行和行李，请推荐换乘最少的路线。','Please take me to the library. Considering accessibility and my luggage, please recommend the route with the fewest transfers.','["Bitte","bringen","Sie","mich","zu","die","Bibliothek","Empfehlen","Sie","mir","unter","Berücksichtigung","der","Barrierefreiheit","und","meines","Gepäcks","die","Route","mit","den","wenigsten","Umstiegen"]','die Bibliothek','smartlingo_original_cefr_aligned','published',unixepoch(),unixepoch());
