VALUES('sentence:2026-08-21.2:de:advanced:pharmacy:3','2026-08-21.2','de','advanced','B1+-B2-aligned',5,8,93,'pharmacy','directions','Bitte zeigen Sie mir den Weg zu die Apotheke. Vergleichen Sie bitte den schnellsten mit dem bequemsten Weg und nennen Sie die jeweilige Dauer.','请告诉我怎么去药店。 请比较最快和最方便的路线，并说明各自需要多久。','Please show me how to get to the pharmacy. Please compare the fastest route with the most convenient one and explain how long each takes.','["Bitte","zeigen","Sie","mir","den","Weg","zu","die","Apotheke","Vergleichen","Sie","bitte","den","schnellsten","mit","dem","bequemsten","Weg","und","nennen","Sie","die","jeweilige","Dauer"]','die Apotheke','smartlingo_original_cefr_aligned','published',unixepoch(),unixepoch());
VALUES('sentence:2026-08-21.2:de:advanced:pharmacy:4','2026-08-21.2','de','advanced','B1+-B2-aligned',5,7,94,'pharmacy','distance','Ist die Apotheke weit von hier? Falls der öffentliche Verkehr ausfällt, nennen Sie mir bitte verlässliche Alternativen.','药店离这里远吗？ 如果公共交通暂停，请告诉我还有哪些可靠的选择。','Is the pharmacy far from here? If public transport is suspended, please tell me which reliable alternatives are available.','["Ist","die","Apotheke","weit","von","hier","Falls","der","öffentliche","Verkehr","ausfällt","nennen","Sie","mir","bitte","verlässliche","Alternativen"]','die Apotheke','smartlingo_original_cefr_aligned','published',unixepoch(),unixepoch());
